# Added by 2026-11-03 security audit (preventive: generic key files and
# Substrate's on-disk node key name, which has no extension)
*.key
*.pem
# Exception: the bundled Mozilla CA root bundle is a public certificate
# set, intentionally shipped in the APK (see app/assets/CA-SOURCE.txt).
!app/assets/cacert.pem
secret_ed25519
node-key

